OL,3,GNEWSAMichael Flatley says 'heart is
OL,4,Abroken' after death of wife, Niamh
OL,5,AO'Brien
OL,6,
OL,7,FNiamh O'Brien, a former lead performer
OL,8,Fin Lord of the Dance and the wife of
OL,9,FRiverdance star Michael Flatley, has
OL,10,Fdied at the age of 52.
OL,12,FAnnouncing her death on social media on
OL,13,FMonday, Flatley said his "heart is
OL,14,Fbroken".
OL,16,F"My gorgeous bride of twenty years has
OL,17,Fgone to the Lord in Heaven."
OL,19,FO'Brien was a renowned Irish dancer who
OL,20,Fperformed the lead role of Saoirse in
OL,21,Fthe Lord of the Dance shows.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
